  "title": "Carrier Management features an article on the relationship between legal finance and insurance",
  "summary": "Carrier Management features an article that focuses on what Burford Managing Director Andy Lundberg refers to as the \"love-hate relationship\" between legal finance and the insurance industry. As Lundberg says, \"JPI and legal finance are complementary products; both deal in legal risk, but the water flows in different directions.\"",
